<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We must redeem the time!</l><l>The Lord is drawing nigh.</l><l>And just around the bend</l><l>We’ll hear the midnight cry.</l><l>Redeem the time!</l><l>Seize every opportunity;</l><l>Redeem the time!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We must redeem the time!</l><l>Each opportunity</l><l>Will come and pass</l><l>Ne’er to return eternally.</l><l>Redeem the time!</l><l>Seize every opportunity;</l><l>Redeem the time!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We must redeem the time!</l><l>Buy back the time we’ve lost.</l><l>Forsaking all to pay the price</l><l>Is worth the cost.</l><l>Redeem the time!</l><l>Seize every opportunity;</l><l>Redeem the time!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>We must redeem the time!</l><l>We have not time to spare;</l><l>Each moment He hath measured</l><l>For us to prepare.</l><l>Redeem the time!</l><l>Seize every opportunity;</l><l>Redeem the time!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
